  message: "Fixed in PR #2200. packages/hypergumbo-lang-extended1/pyproject.toml declared no tree-sitter-language-pack on dev although 27 of its analyzers set language_pack_name; it now declares `tree-sitter-language-pack~=0.13.0` (28 analyzers with Agda) and no longer declares tree-sitter-agda. A test (test_grammar_dependencies_declared) compares what the analyzers load with what the package declares; my mutation (the dropped wheel re-declared) fails it. NOT CHECKED: installing hypergumbo-lang-extended1 alone in a clean environment. Repro record (both arms, commands and copied outputs): ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/stable_id_items_review_11152026/pr2/tracker/repros.md; per-package detail: pr2/STATUS.md; churn: pr2/final_measure.txt."  # 71f3
